      "message": "Hi Sarah,\n\nApologies for the delay \u2014 I've followed up with our billing team and the corrected invoice for #2214 (showing $4,200) will be issued and uploaded to the portal by end of day tomorrow (Wednesday). That should give you enough time to process it before your Friday payment run closes.\n\nI'll send you a quick confirmation once it's posted. Thanks for your patience!\n\nBest,\nImpact Team"
